    {
      "q": "What are the top beaches to visit in Havelock Island?",
      "a": "The top beaches are Radhanagar Beach (Beach No. 7) for sunsets, Elephant Beach for coral snorkeling and water sports, and Kalapathar Beach for sunrise and scenic black rocks."
    },
    {
      "q": "What is the best time to visit Havelock Island?",
      "a": "The best time to visit is from October to April when the tropical weather is sunny, humidity is pleasant, and sea visibility is ideal for scuba diving and snorkeling."
